  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "An enchantment is data, so it can do what vanilla's own do: this one is Frost Walker's. minecraft:location_changed runs each time the wearer moves: standing on the ground and not riding, replace_disk turns still water in a disk under the feet (radius 3 at level I, one more per level) into frosted ice, which melts back by itself. minecraft:damage_immunity keeps magma blocks and campfires from burning the feet. exclusive_set keeps it off boots with Depth Strider or Frost Walker. Try /enchant @s msm_examples:rime_step 2 with boots on, then walk onto water.",
